WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Astral Archive - Upper Strata, desperate.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: Falling! Hold... hold on!

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Kael: Grasp it... before...

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.900 align:center
Lyra: Got it! Barely...

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Astral Archive - Mid-Strata Ledge, tense.

6
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.500 align:center
Lyra: Loom. Right there.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.800 align:center
Kael: It watches... always...

8
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.100 align:center
Lyra: No other way. Just... go.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.400 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Astral Archive - Loom's Approach, urgent.

10
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Release it, little one.

11
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one!

12
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.300 align:center
Kael: A shield... now!

13
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.600 align:center
Lyra: Damn it! Take this!

14
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:40.900 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Memory Maze - Shifting Corridors, tense.

15
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.200 align:center
Lyra: Left? Right? It shifts!

16
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.500 align:center
Kael: The pattern... remember...

17
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.800 align:center
Lyra: No pattern! Just... run!

18
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:52.100 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Memory Maze - Central Chamber, dread.

19
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Why cling to dust?

20
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.700 align:center
Lyra: My dust! My choice!

21
00:00:56.1000 --> 00:00:58.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We offer peace. Release.

22
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.300 align:center
Lyra: Never! Get back!

23
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:05.600 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Memory Maze - Swarm Nexus, desperate.

24
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:06.900 align:center
Lyra: Too many! Swarming!

25
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.200 align:center
Kael: The burst... use it!

26
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.500 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one!

27
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.800 align:center
Echo Shard: Join us. Be whole.

28
00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.100 align:center
Lyra: My choice! Not yours!

29
00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:21.400 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Memory Maze - Crumbling Pathway, urgent.

30
00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.700 align:center
Lyra: This way! Trust me!

31
00:01:23.1000 --> 00:01:25.1000 align:center
Kael: It's a trap... I've seen...

32
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.300 align:center
Lyra: No time! We jump!

33
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:33.600 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Memory Maze - Core Junction, dread.

34
00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:34.900 align:center
Lyra: Almost there! Steady!

35
00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.200 align:center
Kael: The maze... falling...

36
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.500 align:center
Lyra: Just a little more!

37
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:43.800 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Memory Garden - False Sanctuary, tense.

38
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.100 align:center
Lyra: A garden? Here?

39
00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.400 align:center
Kael: Too perfect... a lure...

40
00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:48.700 align:center
Lyra: It feels... wrong.

41
00:01:49.1000 --> 00:01:54.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Garden - Loom's Revelation, betrayed.

42
00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The Anchor. A foolish destination.

43
00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.600 align:center
Lyra: How... how do you know?

44
00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your path is known. Always.

45
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.200 align:center
Lyra: No... no escape...

46
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:09.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Garden - Exposed Mind, terrified.

47
00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:10.800 align:center
Lyra: Defense! My shard!

48
00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.100 align:center
Kael: It's gone... Lyra...

49
00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.400 align:center
Lyra: No! It was here! Gone?
